{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>WELCOME, TO:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/13d0506afe0d717d55010efc5f0e0e85.avif?t=1761616029\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>ACATALEPSY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The most immersive multiplayer liminal space experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somehow, some way, you've ended up in an agonizing liminal hell. Complete various tasks and dive deeper through several levels. With a procedural level generation system, the map is different and unique every single time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU ARE <u>NOT</u> ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You and your team are not the only ones populating the liminal spaces. Alongside completing your missions, you'll need to avoid the bloodthirsty monsters that lurk around you. Coming face-to-face with a creature here will mean certain death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A <i>BRIEF</i> SOLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you have completed the threshold of tasks and your team has successfully exited a level, you will be presented with an interlude phase. Here, you can view the status of your team, lives remaining, and various other details. All deceased team members will regain their consciousness, but at the cost of a life. Running out of lives means complete and total elimination from the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AN EARLY EXIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Should all team members perish at any given level, the run is immediately ended. This only occurs when at least three players begin the game. It can be one team member surviving a level successfully that brings the team back to life, so you'd better get some friends to rely on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/ae1b39ed45afebd686677d328f9a7f0f.avif?t=1761616029\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922260?t=1761616029","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/7a4c9ed8c7b2687b64378cb9ce7738c950bffd8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761616029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/be467c19c7144bcb94f6ec5934a3f61c2d896e3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761616029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/be467c19c7144bcb94f6ec5934a3f61c2d896e3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761616029","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The general death of the character results in certain death animations of varying graphic intensity. Blood is also visible on the character and the surfaces surrounding the death animations.\r\n\r\nInterlude screens between levels also feature dead players with varying amounts of violence."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>WELCOME, TO:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/13d0506afe0d717d55010efc5f0e0e85.avif?t=1761616029\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>ACATALEPSY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>The most immersive multiplayer liminal space experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somehow, some way, you've ended up in an agonizing liminal hell. Complete various tasks and dive deeper through several levels. With a procedural level generation system, the map is different and unique every single time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU ARE <u>NOT</u> ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You and your team are not the only ones populating the liminal spaces. Alongside completing your missions, you'll need to avoid the bloodthirsty monsters that lurk around you. Coming face-to-face with a creature here will mean certain death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A <i>BRIEF</i> SOLACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you have completed the threshold of tasks and your team has successfully exited a level, you will be presented with an interlude phase. Here, you can view the status of your team, lives remaining, and various other details. All deceased team members will regain their consciousness, but at the cost of a life. Running out of lives means complete and total elimination from the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AN EARLY EXIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Should all team members perish at any given level, the run is immediately ended. This only occurs when at least three players begin the game. It can be one team member surviving a level successfully that brings the team back to life, so you'd better get some friends to rely on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/extras/ae1b39ed45afebd686677d328f9a7f0f.avif?t=1761616029\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p>","developers":["Heavy_Tankr"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922260/1d2c405a7599bba72c4a751612af76f72d12f4a0/header.jpg?t=1761616029","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Uses the Procedural Dungeon Generator plugin.<br />\r\nCopyright \u00a9 Ben Pyton.<br />\r\nLicensed under the CeCILL-C license:<br />\r\nhttps://cecill.info/licences/Licence_CeCILL-C_V1-en.html<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game uses FMOD Studio by Firelight Technologies Pty Ltd.<br />\r\nLicensed under the FMOD End User License Agreement.<br />\r\nhttps://www.fmod.com/licensing","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Acatalepsy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Newer Gen Processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 20 Series<br></li><li><st